*"* use this source file for your ABAP unit test classes
CLASS ltc_savings_account DEFINITION FINAL FOR TESTING
  DURATION SHORT
  RISK LEVEL HARMLESS.

  PRIVATE SECTION.
   DATA mo_cut TYPE REF TO zcl_savings_account.

    METHODS setup.
    METHODS add_interest_increases_balance FOR TESTING RAISING cx_static_check.
ENDCLASS.

CLASS ltc_savings_account IMPLEMENTATION.
   METHOD setup.
    mo_cut = NEW zcl_savings_account( iv_owner = `Test`
                                      iv_rate  = 5 ).
  ENDMETHOD.

    METHOD add_interest_increases_balance.
      mo_cut->deposit( 100 ).
       mo_cut->add_interest( ).

      cl_abap_unit_assert=>assert_equals(
        act = mo_cut->get_balance( )
        exp = 105 ).
    ENDMETHOD.
ENDCLASS.
